{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1187082-so-if-black-dog-is-white-wolf-s-evil-twin","id":1187082,"title":"So, if Black Dog is White Wolf's Evil Twin....","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-17T11:15:25-08:00","id":1187082,"title":"So, if Black Dog is White Wolf's Evil Twin....","content":"Okay, so Black Dog Games Factory (The Pentex subsidiary, not the actual publishing imprint) is basically White Wolf's evil twin, then what is Black Dog's equivalent to the actual Black Dog publishing imprint? What does Black Dog Games Factory feel it's nessicary to put a warning label on? What horrific, nightmarish supplements have they published for Revenant, Lyncanthrope, etc?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/nbylxup\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n18segp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0v25ewp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n77xu8p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1667-novagain","name":"Novagain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-17T11:23:12-08:00","id":1187085,"title":"","content":"Since it's the World of Darkness, I doubt the company cares about warning labels. That's just how grim the setting is.<br /> <br /> Hell, in this universe, Upton Sinclair's &quot;The Jungle&quot; is probably a factually accurate documentary, rather than a bit of sensationalist - but ultimately fictional - bit of fiction. We're probably meant to assume that Black Dog Games Factory is meant to be so unethical, it (and the media) don't care if their products lead to damaging the minds of the youth. Corruption is rampant, so why should the tabletop RPG industry be any different?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":6156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","user":"Bluecho","date":". 02-17-2018, 02:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-17T11:33:34-08:00","id":1187088,"title":"","content":"White Wolf, of course. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-17T11:36:58-08:00","id":1187089,"title":"","content":"If you want a spoof game featuring kids becoming embroiled in a world of evil because of their involvement with rpgs, go for it, but that ground was covered by Dark Dungeons back in the 80s. Black Dog games was a silly self-referential nod and I don't think the joke goes much deeper than that. If you need gross material, just crib from FATAL (or don't, and save yourself a few precious sanity points).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-17T12:09:41-08:00","id":1187111,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Laughing Stranger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1187082-so-if-black-dog-is-white-wolf-s-evil-twin?p=1187089#post1187089\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you want a spoof game featuring kids becoming embroiled in a world of evil because of their involvement with rpgs, go for it, but that ground was covered by Dark Dungeons back in the 80s. Black Dog games was a silly self-referential nod and I don't think the joke goes much deeper than that. If you need gross material, just crib from FATAL (or don't, and save yourself a few precious sanity points).</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, this was mainly a shower though, but now that I'm thinking about it, I could probably find some catharsis after recent events writing up a one shot involving Gorehounds","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/nbylxup\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n18segp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0v25ewp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/n77xu8p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1667-novagain","name":"Novagain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-17T12:44:48-08:00","id":1187119,"title":"","content":"<i>I Love The Dead: The Book of Zombie Sex</i> for Revenant: The Ravishing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-17T12:55:54-08:00","id":1187122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1187082-so-if-black-dog-is-white-wolf-s-evil-twin?p=1187085#post1187085\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since it's the World of Darkness, I doubt the company cares about warning labels. That's just how grim the setting is.<br /> <br /> Hell, in this universe, Upton Sinclair's &quot;The Jungle&quot; is probably a factually accurate documentary, rather than a bit of sensationalist - but ultimately fictional - bit of fiction. We're probably meant to assume that Black Dog Games Factory is meant to be so unethical, it (and the media) don't care if their products lead to damaging the minds of the youth. Corruption is rampant, so why should the tabletop RPG industry be any different?</div> </div> </div> </div>The central character is fictional in that his life is a composit of may different stories Sinclaire reported on over the years as a journalist. The working conditions portrayed and Party Boss exploitation in the book are fundamentally accurate to turn of the century conditions beneath the lurid language.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</